# AI model policy

ProgressFolio uses **Google Gemini Flash-Lite** as the only AI model for
rewriting/summarizing text (commit summaries, weekly share posts, and any
future text cleanup on manual logs).

- All calls go through [`src/lib/ai/gemini.ts`](../../src/lib/ai/gemini.ts).
  Do not call the Gemini SDK directly from elsewhere - add a new exported
  function to that file instead.
- Model id comes from `process.env.GEMINI_MODEL`, defaulting to the rolling
  alias `gemini-flash-lite-latest`.
- Do **not** introduce OpenAI, Anthropic/Claude, or any other AI provider or
  SDK anywhere in this codebase unless the user explicitly asks for it in
  that conversation.
- If a new feature needs text generation, extend `gemini.ts` rather than
  creating a parallel AI client.
